    determine if a set of subsets is a triangulation of a point set
  * *note topcomRegularTriangulationWeights:
    topcomRegularTriangulationWeights_lpMatrix_cmList_rp, -- find a list of
    heights of a regular triangulation
  * *note convexHull: (Polyhedra)convexHull, -- computing the convex hull of
    points, rays and polyhedra

